1612 (ii) determine whether the identification presented:
1613 (A) is a type of valid voter identification described in Subsection 20A-1-102(85)(a) or (b); and
1615 (B) in accordance with Subsection (4), identifies the individual presenting the identification as the voter
to whom the ballot relates.
